# CS2 Optimizer Pro

Free and open-source Windows optimizer designed for Counter-Strike 2.

## Features
- Safe & Ultra optimization modes
- Automatic AMD / NVIDIA detection
- Full backup & restore system
- Multilingual (Polish / English)
- No installation required

## How to use
1. Download `OptimalizerCS2.py` and the `.bat` file
2. Run the `.bat` as Administrator
   or
3. Run the `.py` file as Administrator

